{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls","id":222684,"title":"Demons and souls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-08T19:22:36-07:00","id":222684,"title":"Demons and souls","content":"Quick question I'm new to Demon and haven't played much but i was just wondering why demons want the souls of humans and what does it do for them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3584-derrek321","name":"Derrek321","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T19:28:02-07:00","id":222711,"title":"","content":"Well demons dont really want the soul they want the humans life just replace soul for everything about the person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T11:01:45-07:00","id":223388,"title":"","content":"Demons need to hide from the attention of the God-Machine from whose service they turned. In order to do this, they wrap &quot;Cover&quot; identities around themselves, appearing as humans with the psychic semblance of preexisting relationships and characteristics. But Covers degrade as they draw attention. The fastest and easiest way to obtain a replacement Cover is to make a deal with a human for their soul and cash it in. The human is then annihilated, while their soul is used as raw materials to construct that psychic semblance, creating a sort of hole the demon can step into. The demon then has the former human's identity as a new Cover, with all of his previous relationships and so on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T16:10:40-07:00","id":223686,"title":"","content":"In a lot of ways, its very much darker than myth. Its one thing to hold a soul inside of yourself for fuel (i see archdemons working that way). Its an other thing to just throw the thing away--no afterlife, no reincarnation, no ghost. Just a demon wearing your face and hugging your kids, boffing your wife.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T00:35:41-07:00","id":223933,"title":"","content":"Reminds me of the kinks song-the conservative man","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-10T18:26:01-07:00","id":224723,"title":"","content":"Like with Infernalists they sell their soul (or at least part of it) to a demon to receive Demonic Investments. So if the Demon only has part of your soul how can they use it as a cover? Doesn't make a whole lot of sense to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3584-derrek321","name":"Derrek321","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T00:27:42-07:00","id":224911,"title":"","content":"They more or less get the &quot;login and password&quot; of your existence. The soul is deleted, and the demon takes its place inside of that human's life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T00:45:37-07:00","id":224921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derrek321</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls?p=224723#post224723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like with Infernalists they sell their soul (or at least part of it) to a demon to receive Demonic Investments. So if the Demon only has part of your soul how can they use it as a cover? Doesn't make a whole lot of sense to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>When a demon has a soul pact they have the rights to the soul and all its attendant trappings.<br /> <br /> The Unchained categorically <i>ceased to exist</i> when they Fell before the development of their Primum squeezed them into the space life had for them in the form of their Cover.<br /> <br /> The Unchained also, by and large, have no use for the soul or those trappings that do not amount to the space life has for it.<br /> <br /> Calling in a soul pact means destroying the soul that inhabits that space and pushing into the vacant slot it leaves to incorporate it into the demon's metaphysical makeup.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-11T00:56:36-07:00","id":224924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Derrek321</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls?p=224723#post224723\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Like with Infernalists they sell their soul (or at least part of it) to a demon to receive Demonic Investments. So if the Demon only has part of your soul how can they use it as a cover? Doesn't make a whole lot of sense to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>We need to define a few things first, I feel.<br /> <br /> Worth noting right off the bat: the demons from Demon: the Descent are not the demons from Inferno, or strictly follow most infernal interpretations; their abilities are viewed through the lens of Judeo-Christian demons but the hows and whys are very different because the Unchained are fundamentally very different monsters.<br /> <br /> So what's being talked about <i>in the terms of D:tD</i> are actually two different types of pacts: the regular or &quot;patch job&quot; pact, and the soul pact.<br /> <br /> Regular pacts aren't for pieces of the soul. The soul has nothing to do with it. What you trade to a demon are pieces of your <i>identity</i> - if you trade away your wife of ten years for wealth, she remembers being married to the Unchained for all that time, pictures and wedding documents and invitations change, and the only people who remember that she was married to you at all are people who are only vaguely connected and, well, you. You can trade away all sorts of identifying features - your relationships, your records, your addictions and ailments, and a million other factors. You barter away these things that make <i>you identifiable as you</i> and the Unchained uses these features to metaphysically flesh out and expand their Cover.<br /> <br /> The soul pact is a LOT more drastic - it still has nothing to do with the soul <i>per se</i> but while you were trading bits and pieces of you away to the demon before, now you've given him the <i>whole thing</i>; you have given him, in essence, the ability to repossess (ha!) the entirety of your identity at a later date for a bill of goods and services right now. You get the money, the power, whatever. At any point, though, the demon can waltz back into your life and collect, at which point the driving force behind you (which isn't technically the soul but encompasses it)is hollowed out and the demon slips in, and all your identifiable features - your body, your relationships, your stuff, etc. - are his. He doesn't have your memories or your personality but you've been replaced by one of the premier deceivers in the entire cosmos, so while you've been replaced by what is essentially a pod person you can only imagine how far a clever demon can go with a quick tongue and some prior knowledge.<br /> <br /> Remember, what the Unchained trade for in Descent isn't a person's soul, it's their <i>context</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":451,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","user":"Kirby Jerusalem","date":". 08-11-2014, 04:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T18:41:22-07:00","id":229810,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cleverest of Things</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls?p=224911#post224911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They more or less get the &quot;login and password&quot; of your existence. The soul is deleted, and the demon takes its place inside of that human's life.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I don't like this. It seems wasteful. We know the God Machine is aware of ghosts and incorporates them into it's designs, from the angel running the ghost fueled power station. I would like to see something where the human who's soul is collected is held in abeyance, and the Demon can arrange for the Cover to Die (or burn the cover), releasing a ghost whose passions and powers the Demon was able to choose before letting it loose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3698-bramble_thorn","name":"Bramble_Thorn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T20:25:16-07:00","id":229895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bramble_Thorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls?p=229810#post229810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I don't like this. It seems wasteful. We know the God Machine is aware of ghosts and incorporates them into it's designs, from the angel running the ghost fueled power station. I would like to see something where the human who's soul is collected is held in abeyance, and the Demon can arrange for the Cover to Die (or burn the cover), releasing a ghost whose passions and powers the Demon was able to choose before letting it loose.</div> </div> </div> </div>Make an Interlock or an Exploit for that. Doh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-17T01:26:32-07:00","id":231197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bramble_Thorn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/222684-demons-and-souls?p=229810#post229810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I don't like this. It seems wasteful. We know the God Machine is aware of ghosts and incorporates them into it's designs, from the angel running the ghost fueled power station. I would like to see something where the human who's soul is collected is held in abeyance, and the Demon can arrange for the Cover to Die (or burn the cover), releasing a ghost whose passions and powers the Demon was able to choose before letting it loose.</div> </div> </div> </div>Certainly make an interesting character in Wraith. As far as the demon goes the deletion of a soul actually is rather practical. As you've said the GM ,or it's agents, have occasionally used ghosts to their benefit, so a ghost of a soul pact earned cover would be a hazard for the demon. I mean think about it be rather suspicious if someone encountered a ghost to someone who is not dead and the whole point of a cover is to avoid suspicion. At the same time an active soul could seek some form of retribution against the demon and thus screw up plans, so removing it from the equation is also beneficial. It may even be practical from the perspective of the GM if the ability exists in angels as well but rarely sees use.<br /> <br /> A thing you might want to know is that in the core it mentions a demon having to hold onto their physical contracts. It mentions that the destruction of a contract nullifies it and undoes the terms of it. So if someone made a pact of their wife in exchange for their own health they; the person gets better and the demon get's the wife. Then the contract is destroyed, the person get's the wife back and the medical condition returns if it is at all possible for it to return. It implied that this also held true for soul pacts, so you could theorize that a soul is just in a null state and is incapable of becoming a ghost or the like because the universe still has them as alive and the soul is on hold. Then the contract get's destroyed the demon loses the cover and the person get's their life back. Unless the cover was burned then it's up to the storyteller to decide if the contracted get's to be a ghost,move on, or if they're just s.o.l. and their soul is burned up with the cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}